BCC_Q({"y": 2025, "n": 1, "part": "A", "topic": "ds", "title": "Merging Cars", "answer": 3, "story": "<p>Cars waiting to enter Main Street are shown. The cars take turns\ncoming from Spruce Street and Oak Street.<\/p>\n<div class=\"center\">\n<p> <img alt=\"From first to last, the five cars lined up on Spruce Street are green, orange, light blue, purple, and then red, and the six cars lined up on Oak Street are grey, white, dark blue, brown, yellow, and pink.\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" style=\"width:600pt\"/> <\/p>\n<\/div>", "question": "<p>If the first car comes from Spruce Street, which car will enter Main\nStreet immediately after <img alt=\"the purple car that is fourth in line on Spruce Street.\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" style=\"width:0.55556in; vertical-align:bottom;\"/>?<\/p>\n<ol class=\"mc\">\n<li><img alt=\"Red car that is fifth in line on Spruce Street.\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" style=\"width:0.55556in; vertical-align:middle;\"/><\/li>\n<li><img alt=\"Light blue car that is third in line on Spruce Street.\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" style=\"width:0.55556in; vertical-align:middle;\"/><\/li>\n<li><img alt=\"Dark blue car that is third in line on Oak Street.\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" style=\"width:0.55556in; vertical-align:middle;\"/><\/li>\n<li><img alt=\"Brown car that is fourth in line on Oak Street.\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" style=\"width:0.55556in; vertical-align:middle;\"/><\/li>\n<\/ol>", "answerHtml": "<p>(D) <img alt=\"Brown car\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" style=\"width:0.55556in; vertical-align:middle;\"/> <\/p>", "explanation": "<p>Assuming no more cars arrive, the cars shown will enter Main Street\nfrom right to left as shown:<\/p>\n<div class=\"center\">\n<p> <img alt=\"Green car from Spruce, grey car from Oak, orange from Spruce, white from Oak, light blue from Spruce, Dark blue from Oak, purple from Spruce, brown from Oak, and so on.\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" style=\"width:650pt\"/> <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>We can see that <img alt=\"the brown car fourth in line on Oak Street\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" style=\"width:0.55556in; vertical-align:bottom;\"/> enters Main Street immediately after <img alt=\"the purple car fourth in line on Spruce Street.\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" style=\"width:0.55556in; vertical-align:bottom;\"/>.<\/p>", "connections": "", "mc": 1});